&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At Fieldwire, we’re looking for our next Chief of Staff to have the following skills and experiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
